### Description 


> SpendWise-C is a lightweight CLI expense tracker built in C that allows users to record, view, and analyze expenses. It uses structs, functions, and file handling for persistent storage and includes category-wise spending analysis and budget comparison.

### AI Usage


> AI was used for brainstorming ideas, debugging support, and improving project documentation. The project logic, implementation, testing, and customization were done by our team.


